  "description": "Test 7, EstimateDesirability vs the update (Python curve model). Baseline 25. Transient curve (-127,-100)(127,100), transient -1: the estimate reads the low byte unsigned (255) -> 25 + 100 = 125; the update uses -1 -> -0.7874069 -> 0 -> 25. Park curve (-100,-10)(100,10), park 300: estimate uses 44 -> 4.4000006 -> +4 (29); the update uses 300 -> +10 (35). Garbage (R$ shipped curve) on a landfill cell (bit 15 set, value -32768 + 300): the estimate reads it unsigned (33068 -> clamped -25 -> 0); the update's walker passes -32468 -> clamped +25 -> 50 (quirks 2 and 5).",
  "steps": [
